"\n"
"Simply select card packs you want to be included and continue by pressing the arrow on the bottom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_ui:200"
msgid ""
"One last thing... a tall man left a suitcase for you this morning. He said you will know the password.\n"
"\n"
"...I wonder, what could that mean?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_ui:201"
msgid ""
"[CITY OF SHIOKAWA, JAPAN. 198X]\n"
"SOMETHING STRANGE IS HAPPENING IN OUR TOWN..."
msgstr ""
"[CIUDAD DE SHIOKAWA, JAPÓN. 198X]\n"
"ALGO EXTRAÑO ESTÁ SUCEDIENDO EN NUESTRA CIUDAD..."

msgctxt "woh_ui:202"
msgid ""
"ROBED FIGURES CAN BE SEEN GATHERING IN THE WOODS AT NIGHT. PEOPLE ARE GOING MISSING.\n"
"DISGUSTING CREATURES ARE TERRORIZING THE SEASIDE..."
msgstr ""
"FIGURAS ENCAPUCHADAS SE PUEDEN VER REUNIÉNDOSE EN EL BOSQUE POR LA NOCHE. LA GENTE ESTÁ DESAPARECIENDO.\n"
"CRIATURAS REPUGNANTES ESTÁN ATERRORIZANDO LA COSTA..."

msgctxt "woh_ui:203"
msgid ""
"THE RAPID TECHNOLOGICAL PROGRESS OF THE MODERN ERA BRINGS COMFORT...\n"
"BUT ALSO NEW UNKNOWN THREATS."
msgstr ""
"EL RÁPIDO PROGRESO TECNOLÓGICO DE LA ERA MODERNA TRAE COMODIDAD...\n"
"PERO TAMBIÉN NUEVAS AMENAZAS DESCONOCIDAS."

msgctxt "woh_ui:204"
msgid ""
"OLD GODS, MALICIOUS ELDRITCH BEINGS WHO RULED THE EARTH EONS AGO,\n"
"ARE AWAKENING AS REALITY STARTS TO CRUMBLE..."
msgstr ""
"DIOSES ANTIGUOS, SERES ÉLDRICOS Y MALÉVOLOS QUE GOBERNARON LA TIERRA HACE EONES,\n"
"ESTÁN DESPERTANDO A MEDIDA QUE LA REALIDAD EMPIEZA A DESMORONARSE..."

msgctxt "woh_ui:205"
msgid ""
"ARMED WITH CLUES, SPELLS, AND YOUR DWINDLING SANITY, YOU'LL INVESTIGATE\n"
"MYSTERIES ACROSS THE CITY... AND IN REALMS BEYOND."
msgstr ""
"ARMADO CON PISTAS, HECHIZOS, Y TU MENGUANTE CORDURA, INVESTIGARÁS\n"
"MISTERIOS POR TODA LA CIUDAD... Y EN REINOS MÁS ALLÁ."

msgctxt "woh_ui:206"
msgid ""
"AN OLD TRAIN SLOWS DOWN AND STOPS AT ITS LAST STATION.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"THE END OF THE WORLD IS AT HAND, AND YOU'VE FINALLY ARRIVED IN THE DOOMED TOWN..."
msgstr ""
"UN VIEJO TREN REDUCE LA VELOCIDAD Y SE DETIENE EN SU ÚLTIMA ESTACIÓN.\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"EL FIN DEL MUNDO SE CERCA, Y FINALMENTE LLEGASTE A LA CIUDAD CAÓTICA..."

