msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:6"
msgid ""
"The wall opens even further... deeper...\n"
"A girl lies curled up inside of the apartment's womb.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
">>i j u s t want y o u to be safe h e r e<<\n"
">>what d i d i do?<<\n"
">>why won't you j u s t s t a y?<<"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:7"
msgid "Sumire-san thought she had everything she wanted. That is, until she met you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:8"
msgid ">>stay w i t h me<<"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:9"
msgid ">>p l e a s e don't leave<<"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:10"
msgid ">>I will t a k e care of y o u<<"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:11"
msgid "RESTLESS RUMORS OF A RESIDENTIAL RECLUSE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:12"
msgid ""
"While you don't get much normalcy in your life these days, today was supposed to be just that.\n"
"\n"
"You'd been planning to take today to de-stress before your next investigation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:13"
msgid ""
"Instead, you awoke to find yourself trapped inside your own apartment. The walls have grown over the door and windows, leaving no exit.\n"
"\n"
"Looking through the peephole, you yell and call out to passing neighbours, but your cries fall on deaf ears."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:14"
msgid ""
"Who could have done this to you?\n"
"\n"
"More importantly, how are you going to get out of here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:15"
msgid "RESIDENTAL RECLUSE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:16"
msgid "FRONT DOOR"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:17"
msgid "PEEPHOLE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:18"
msgid "CLOSET"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:19"
msgid "KITCHEN"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:20"
msgid "YOUR ROOM"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:21"
msgid "MAIN ROOM"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:22"
msgid "??"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:23"
msgid "PREPARE FOR COMBAT"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:24"
msgid "SACRIFICE THE TOY"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:25"
msgid "WASTE ANOTHER DAY"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:26"
msgid "APPROACH THE WALL"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:27"
msgid "LOOK THROUGH PEEPHOLE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:28"
msgid "SACRIFICE THE TOY"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:29"
msgid "LOOK BENEATH SHELVES"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:30"
msgid "CHECK THE NOTE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:31"
msgid "Something guides your hand. What is this?..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:32"
msgid "You don't find anything else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:33"
msgid ""
"[[I used to live here too. This was the only place that was saf(...)d good.\n"
"All I could do was stay in, eat and sleep. And when the food ran out, just sleep.]]\n"
"[[When someone eventually came for my corpse, I'd already made my way _inside_.]]\n"
"[[You moved it. I can't tell you how happy being with you has made me. Please don't worry, I will keep you safe. I promise.]]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:34"
msgid ""
"...wait, what's that? \n"
"(+ ITEM)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:35"
msgid "You don't have the energy to keep searching."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:36"
msgid ""
"You look around but don't find anything. \n"
"(+2% DOOM)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:37"
msgid "CHECK BEHIND WARDROBE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:38"
msgid "CHECK BEHIND BED"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:39"
msgid "CHECK BEHIND DESK"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:40"
msgid ""
"The windows are covered in a thick layer of drywall, leaving only shallow cavities. The front door isn't much better.\n"
"\n"
"But there must be some way out, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:41"
msgid "You spend all of your time searching your apartment for a way out, but you're already getting exhausted."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:42"
msgid "Wallpaper and paint have spread around the door's edges. No matter how hard you try, the door refuses to budge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:43"
msgid "...at least he can't get through, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:44"
msgid "Your sleep schedule is starting to drift. The hours just seem to slip past you, and the day is over before you know it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:45"
msgid "Wallpaper and paint have spread around the door's edges. No matter how hard you try, the door refuses to budge."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:46"
msgid "There's a weird drawing stuck to your door..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:47"
msgid ""
"You've read all of your books and watched all of your VHS tapes three times over.\n"
"\n"
"God, you miss people."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:48"
msgid ""
"You wonder just how much things are changing out there without you around.\n"
"\n"
"If nothing else, you're at least safer in here than out there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:49"
msgid "You don't see anything of interest in the hallway today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:50"
msgid "You still change clothes every day, but is there any point if you're not going outside?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:51"
msgid "Your pantry is starting to run out of easy meals, and you don't have the energy to cook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:52"
msgid "You're running out of ways to keep yourself busy. The boredom makes you want to beat your head against a wall."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:53"
msgid ""
"You wonder just how much things are changing out there without you around.\n"
"\n"
"If nothing else, you're at least safer in here than out there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:54"
msgid "You can't see outside anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:55"
msgid "You still change clothes every day, but is there any point if you're not going outside?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:56"
msgid "Your pantry is starting to run out of easy meals, and you don't have the energy to cook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:57"
msgid ""
"Just standing in here makes you light-headed.\n"
"The bed is too tempting-- you shouldn't stay long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:58"
msgid ""
"Your mind is hazy. It's all blurring together.\n"
"You just want to sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:59"
msgid ""
"You're beginning to doubt this door will ever open again.\n"
"\n"
"(it's better that way)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:60"
msgid "... what were you doing again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:61"
msgid "You don't have much of an appetite."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:62"
msgid "(the apartment cradles you gently in your sleep every night, keeping you warm within her ribcage)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:63"
msgid ""
"As you get closer, you notice thin cracks in the wall above the bed. Something dark, glistening red pulsates inside. The cracks move like lips, and the apartment whispers to you.\n"
">>just lay down<<\n"
"\n"
"You hear wooden support beams creak as the walls flex, reaching toward you from all sides.\n"
">>and let me take care of you<<"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:64"
msgid "MYSTERY MEAT"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:65"
msgid ""
"No access to the outside world means you only have so much food to eat.\n"
"\n"
"Deep in the back of your pantry, you discover a rusty can of meat. How long this has this thing been in here? \n"
"\n"
"Opening the can, it smells fine, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:66"
msgid "eat it"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:67"
msgid "throw it away"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:68"
msgid ""
"It's not exactly a pleasant meal - meat definitely shouldn't be this crunchy - but food is food.\n"
"(+2 STAMINA)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:69"
msgid ""
"You already regret your decision by the first disgusting bite. \n"
"\n"
"An hour later, you feel something writhing in your stomach, trying to get out. Maybe that meat was too fresh...\n"
"(+ STATUS)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:70"
msgid ""
"Trusting your judgement, you chuck the can into the garbage. Your stomach growls at you in discontentment.\n"
"(-1 STAMINA)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:71"
msgid "CLOGGED DRAIN"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:72"
msgid ""
"When you go to use the bathroom, you notice there's a clump of hair coming up the sink drain. \n"
"\n"
"You're certain that it's not yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:73"
msgid "pull it out"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:74"
msgid ""
"You tug the strand up out of the drain, only to find a few coins tied to the end of the hair. You pocket the money and try not to think about it.\n"
"(+1 FUNDS)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:75"
msgid ""
"There's a startling amount of resistance when you pull. Before you can react, the hair is suddenly yanked back down the drain and out of sight.\n"
"(-1 REASON)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:76"
msgid "KILLING TIME"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:77"
msgid ""
"Sitting on the sofa, you find yourself repeatedly checking the time to get some grounding.\n"
"\n"
"When you go to eat, though, you realize the clock in the kitchen displays a different time. And your bedroom alarm clock is completely different from each of the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:78"
msgid "<<they need a battery change, probably>>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:79"
msgid "<<I must be delirious>>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:80"
msgid ""
"You're sure there's some explanation. You shrug it off and get your food.\n"
"\n"
"You pretend you're not nauseous when the clocks later show negative numbers, jumbled words, and nothing at all.\n"
"(+1 STAMINA / -2 REASON)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:81"
msgid ""
"Being stuck in here is really starting to get to your head. To set yourself straight, you slap yourself hard enough to see stars, chug some coffee, and avoid looking at the clocks again.\n"
"(+1 REASON / -2 STAMINA)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:82"
msgid "WASTING ANOTHER DAY..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:83"
msgid "A - FINALLY FREE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:84"
msgid "B - EVIL EVICTED"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:85"
msgid ""
"The girl's face twists oddly. The apartment's pulsing innards slow to a still.\n"
"\n"
"The girl mouths something you can't make out. She smiles. You fall unconscious.\n"
"\n"
"When you awaken, you're laying in the apartment entryway, beside the open door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:86"
msgid ""
"The next morning, you see a silhouette on the balcony, staring out at Shiokawa and watching the sunrise.\n"
"You blink, and she's gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:87"
msgid ""
"After that, you never see her again, and after that, your apartment becomes just an apartment.\n"
"\n"
"[RESTLESS RUMORS OF A RESIDENTIAL RECLUSE:\n"
"ENDING A]"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:88"
msgid ""
"An expression of agony overtakes the girl's face. Her hair gets tangled into the apartment's churning guts, and her flesh begins to melt apart.\n"
"She arches her back in a voiceless scream until her pale body finally collapses in on itself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:89"
msgid ""
"When you stumble out of the room, things seem to have returned to normal, and your door can open again. Relieved, you take the chance to go out for a walk.\n"
"Only a few hours later do you return to the bedroom, and find a lump beneath your bed's covers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:90"
msgid "Peeling back the sheets reveals the toy that you had destroyed, the pieces held together with sections of pulsing flesh. Beside its body is a small note."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "woh_yon:91"
msgid ""
